 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
 
+## Board Publication
+
+Publishing a board makes a read-only version of it available to anyone who has its secret public URL, without signing in. Only account admins can publish and unpublish boards.
+
+### `POST /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Publishes the board. Publishing an already published board keeps its existing public URL.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `201 Created` with the board in the same shape as `GET /:account_slug/boards/:board_id`, including its `public_url`:
+
+```json
+{
+  "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+  "name": "Fizzy",
+  "all_access": true,
+  "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.534Z",
+  "auto_postpone_period_in_days": 30,
+  "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/boards/03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+  "public_url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/public/boards/p94Bx2HjempCdYB4DTyZkY1b",
+  "creator": {
+    "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+    "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+    "role": "owner",
+    "active": true,
+    "email_address": "david@example.com",
+    "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+    "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+  }
+}
+```
+
+The public board, its columns, and its published cards can then be opened without authentication at:
+
+- `GET /:account_slug/public/boards/:key`
+- `GET /:account_slug/public/boards/:key/columns/:column_id`
+- `GET /:account_slug/public/boards/:key/cards/:card_number`
+
+### `DELETE /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Unpublishes the board. The public URL stops working immediately, and publishing the board again generates a new one.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
 ## Board Accesses
 
 Board accesses let you see who has access to a board and their involvement level (watching or access only). Any board member can view this information.
diff --git a/test/controllers/boards/publications_controller_test.rb b/test/controllers/boards/publications_controller_test.rb
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..3961830
--- /dev/null
+++ b/test/controllers/boards/publications_controller_test.rb
@@ -0,0 +1,116 @@
+require "test_helper"
+
+class Boards::PublicationsControllerTest < ActionDispatch::IntegrationTest
+  setup do
+    sign_in_as :kevin
+    @board = boards(:writebook)
+  end
+
+  test "create" do
+    assert_changes -> { @board.reload.published? }, from: false, to: true do
+      post board_publication_path(@board)
+    end
+
+    assert_redirected_to edit_board_path(@board)
+  end
+
+  test "create as turbo stream" do
+    post board_publication_path(@board), as: :turbo_stream
+
+    assert_response :success
+    assert @board.reload.published?
+    assert_turbo_stream action: :replace, target: dom_id(@board, :publication)
+    assert_includes response.body, public_board_url(@board.publication)
+  end
+
+  test "create as JSON" do
+    post board_publication_path(@board), as: :json
+
+    assert_response :created
+    assert @board.reload.published?
+    assert_equal public_board_url(@board.publication), @response.parsed_body["public_url"]
+  end
+
+  test "create is idempotent" do
+    @board.publish
+    key = @board.publication.key
+
+    assert_no_difference -> { Board::Publication.count } do
+      post board_publication_path(@board)
+    end
+
+    assert_equal key, @board.reload.publication.key
+  end
+
+  test "destroy" do
+    @board.publish
+
+    assert_changes -> { @board.reload.published? }, from: true, to: false do
+      delete board_publication_path(@board)
+    end
+
+    assert_redirected_to edit_board_path(@board)
+  end
+
+  test "destroy as turbo stream" do
+    @board.publish
+    public_url = public_board_url(@board.publication)
+
+    delete board_publication_path(@board), as: :turbo_stream
+
+    assert_response :success
+    assert_not @board.reload.published?
+    assert_turbo_stream action: :replace, target: dom_id(@board, :publication) do
+      assert_select "form[action=?][method=post]", board_publication_path(@board)
+      assert_select "input[value=?]", public_url, count: 0
+    end
+  end
+
+  test "destroy as JSON" do
+    @board.publish
+
+    delete board_publication_path(@board), as: :json
+
+    assert_response :no_content
+    assert_not @board.reload.published?
+  end
+
+  test "non-admins cannot publish a board" do
+    logout_and_sign_in_as :jz
+
+    post board_publication_path(@board)
+
+    assert_response :forbidden
+    assert_not @board.reload.published?
+  end
+
+  test "non-admins cannot unpublish a board" do
+    @board.publish
+    logout_and_sign_in_as :jz
+
+    delete board_publication_path(@board)
+
+    assert_response :forbidden
+    assert @board.reload.published?
+  end
+
+  test "non-admins cannot publish a board as JSON" do
+    logout_and_sign_in_as :jz
+
+    post board_publication_path(@board), as: :json
+
+    assert_response :forbidden
+    assert_not @board.reload.published?
+  end
+
+  test "cannot publish a board without access to it" do
+    board = boards(:private)
+    board.accesses.revise granted: users(:david), revoked: users(:kevin)
+    assert_not board.accessible_to?(users(:kevin))
+
+    post board_publication_path(board)
+
+    assert_response :not_found
+    assert_not board.reload.published?
+  end
+end
